# AI / tooling
# Ignore all .claude dirs (root + per-package), but track root .claude/commands,
# root .claude/rules (path-scoped instructions — see CLAUDE.md) and the root
# .claude/prompts that a tracked file cites — a new citation adds its line here
**/.claude/
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/commands/
!/.claude/rules/
!/.claude/prompts/
/.claude/prompts/*
!/.claude/prompts/benchmark-harness-audit.md
!/.claude/prompts/boolean-flag-audit.md
!/.claude/prompts/perf-optimization-deep-analysis.md
.sisyphus
.omo

